OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as roadwork delays force
OL,4,Apothole diversions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resident said the closure of a
OL,7,Fvillage road since May has caused a
OL,8,F"big loss" to the local community, with
OL,9,Fevents cancelled and drivers forced
OL,10,Fonto heavily potholed diversion routes.
OL,12,FSevern Trent is carrying out a major
OL,13,Fwater mains renewal scheme on a road
OL,14,Fthrough Stoke St Milborough,
OL,15,FShropshire, replacing around 2.3km of
OL,16,Fpipe after a high number of burst water
OL,17,Fmains.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
