OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as roadwork delays force
OL,4,Apothole diversions
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraham Price, chairman of the parish
OL,7,Fcouncil, said there had been "scant
OL,8,Fregard" for the impact the long-running
OL,9,Fworks were having on local people in a
OL,10,Fvillage where community facilities are
OL,11,Flimited.
OL,13,FThe closure was originally expected to
OL,14,Fend in September. However, the council
OL,15,Fsaid the completion date will now be 16
OL,16,FDecember.
